INSERT INTO site_content (`id`,`title_en`,`title_zh`,`category_en`,`category_zh`,`summary_en`,`summary_zh`,`content_en`,`content_zh`,`features_en`,`features_zh`,`specifications_en`,`specifications_zh`,`image`,`status`,`show_on_home`,`home_order`,`type`,`title`,`category`,`summary`,`content`,`industry`,`industry_ids`,`date`) SELECT 'offshore-pipeline-structure','Offshore pipeline structure','海上管道模块','Energy infrastructure','能源基础设施','Pipeline structure are integrated passage facilities used for the centralized installation of various pipelines, including electricity, communications, and water supply and drainage, and are widely used in urban infrastructure construction. The Pipeline structure produced by TZME adopt a prefabricated modular design, featuring fast construction speed, long service life, and easy maintenance, effectively enhancing the efficiency of urban underground space utilization.','面向油气生产、运输与消费环节的模块化管道结构，采用预制与装配工艺，衔接管道布置、结构制造及现场安装。','Pipeline structure are integrated passage facilities used for the centralized installation of various pipelines, including electricity, communications, and water supply and drainage, and are widely used in urban infrastructure construction. The Pipeline structure produced by TZME adopt a prefabricated modular design, featuring fast construction speed, long service life, and easy maintenance, effectively enhancing the efficiency of urban underground space utilization.','面向油气生产、运输与消费环节的模块化管道结构，采用预制与装配工艺，衔接管道布置、结构制造及现场安装。','Oil-gas pipeline modules are critical infrastructure connecting energy production, transportation, and consumption, enabling the safe and efficient transfer of oil, natural gas, and other materials through an intensive and enclosed piping system. The oil-gas pipeline modules manufactured by TZME reach a single-unit length of 95.2 meters, which is currently one of the longest single module in the industry. Manufacturing adheres to internationally leading pipeline modules design standards and prefabrication processes, demanding extremely high structural precision(with millimeters level tolerances) and construction period requirements.
Prefabricated and Modular Design: Utilizes a prefabricated and modular design for rapid construction and installation.
High Durability: Uses high-performance concrete and anti-corrosion materials to ensure long-term stable operation.
Space Optimization: Optimized pipeline layout maximizes the use of underground space and reduces redundant construction.
Intelligent Management: Equipped with an intelligent monitoring system to real-time monitor the operation status of the utility tunnel and improve management efficiency.','油气管道模块预制与装配
